    ✅ converged in 284s — 4 modes, highest-Q at 2.450554 GHz, Q=36,186 (NLEPS 16)

  ✅ best configuration: both (plasma_h=1.0, target=2.4, 284s)
  🔑 F2: the baseline stalled and both did NOT — so the stall was the CONFIGURATION, not Palace.

